WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.687
Good morning, and thank you.

2
00:00:01.687 --> 00:00:05.104
Digital identity has two
faces: the public who sign in

3
00:00:05.104 --> 00:00:08.675
to an agency's services, and
the workforce who serve them.

4
00:00:08.675 --> 00:00:12.021
Both rest on the same data
discipline: one person,

5
00:00:12.021 --> 00:00:17.375
one key the agency controls, and every
fact owned by one authoritative source.

6
00:00:17.375 --> 00:00:20.922
I'll show that discipline
through the workforce face,

7
00:00:20.922 --> 00:00:25.437
because Federal HR 2.0 puts it on
participating agencies' calendars.

8
00:00:25.437 --> 00:00:29.046
I have one proposal, and I'll
take it through four questions,

9
00:00:29.046 --> 00:00:32.954
the way I'd take it to leadership:
why it matters, what we should do,

10
00:00:32.954 --> 00:00:37.313
who has to be involved, and how we'd
carry it out and know it's working.
